From cd9612fc6c37d2363058dccee616692d082fdc37 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Russell Ballestrini <russell@unturf.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 19/29] b43: AC-PHY: A-MPDU TX on core rev >= 40 with wl's hardware aggregation

wl's AQM aggregation: the epoch bit, the aggregate tail, bursts of same
session frames, the block ack status reported to minstrel_ht as
transmission rounds (not MPDUs) and the status of a plain session frame
(every rate probe) as a one-MPDU aggregate, else the rate can only fall
(acphy_ampdu bits 1..10).
---
