 drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/b43/dma.c  | 265 +++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/b43/dma.h  |   9 +
 drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/b43/main.c |  91 +++++++++-
